# Dependencies
**/node_modules

# Build output
**/dist
release/
backend/prisma/dev.db.template

# Env / secrets.
# Matched by CLASS, not by name. Listing `.env` and `.env.local` individually is
# what let `backend/.env.qc` (real JWT secret, USDA key, seed email + cleartext
# password) ship inside a built installer — the same denylist-by-enumeration
# failure that `build.files` in package.json was inverted to an allowlist to fix.
# Any new .env variant is ignored by default; add an explicit `!` only for a file
# you have READ and confirmed carries no secret.
**/.env*
!**/.env.example

# Local databases + phase backups.
# Also matched by class. SQLite writes sidecars next to the DB (`-wal`, `-shm`
# under WAL mode, `-journal` otherwise) and every one of them holds real rows:
# `dev.db-wal` was 74 KB of live user data. Agent/QC runs additionally leave
# `.db.snapshot-*` and `.db.backup-*` copies. None of those end in `.db`, so a
# bare `*.db` rule misses all of them.
# The repo is PUBLIC — one `git add -A` on any of these publishes a real
# person's health records. Do not narrow these patterns.
*.db
*.db-*
*.db.*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-*

# Git bundles used to shuttle work between machines/sessions. They contain
# full history and are regenerable; never commit one into the history it holds.
*.bundle

# Agent scratch directories. Build/verify agents materialise DB copies and
# intermediate artifacts here (one run left 17 MB). Regenerable by definition,
# and a stray `add -A` would otherwise commit a copy of the personal database
# onto a PUBLIC repo. Broadened to every scratch/qc-scratch naming an agent picks.
.scratch*/
**/scratchpad/
*scratch*/
.qc-scratch*/
**/qc-scratch*/

# Audit/fix run artifacts (regenerate with scripts/auditFoodData.mjs)
backend/reports/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor folders
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/

# Internal dev docs — local-only (contain personal/health data).
# CLAUDE.md itself is now tracked: rewritten in Phase 0 with generic rules only.
CLAUDE_RECOMP_ARCHIVE.md
AUDIT.md
PABLO_REVIEW.md
roadmap/09-ux-onboarding.md
HANDOFF.md

# Design-inspiration library — local-only. Scraped third-party imagery
# (Dribbble shots, vendor marketing mockups); must never ship in the
# public repo. Browse locally via docs/design/inspiration/contact-sheet.html
docs/design/inspiration/

# 2026-07-29 systems audit — local-only, same reason as the block above.
# 169 findings naming live weaknesses in this app by file:line, plus the
# note that ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / JWT_SECRET / USDA_API_KEY were materialized
# into agent transcripts and want rotating. A public repo is the last place
# that belongs. Rescued 2026-08-02 from Desktop/cut-protocol-audit, where it
# was the ONLY copy and untracked; see CLAUDE.md's Archive section.
docs/audit/systems-2026-07-29/

# QC gauntlet raw per-run stream (regenerable; report + failures are committed)
docs/qc/mc-results.jsonl
backend/.env.qc

*.bundle

# fleet measurement scratch — agent DB copies, never committed
fleet/scratch/
